,"severity_phrase":"","subtype":null,"price":"","availability":"The US embargo bans the import of Cuban medicines; patients travel through third countries or carry refrigerated doses back. US clinical trials at Roswell Park, Buffalo, New York.","approval":"Developed by Cuba's Center of Molecular Immunology. Not approved by the US FDA.","note":"Targets the epidermal growth factor (EGF) that lung cancer cells need; manages the cancer as a chronic condition, without the toxicity of chemotherapy."},{"id":"G064","rel":"TREATED_BY","from":"diseases-and-conditions-non-small-cell-lung-cancer","to":"treatments-and-drugs-cimavax-egf","quote":"CIMAvax was approved in Cuba in 2011. It has since been approved in Argentina, Colombia, Peru, and Paraguay.","source":{"id":"S005","title":"Mad Honey, chapter 4: the pharmaceutical machine (Nir Strulovitz)","origin":"Israel","year":2026,"kind":"book","strength":"review","file":"S005-madhoney-chapter-04-pharma.md"},"frequency_phrase":"","numeric_pct":null,"f_scale":0,"severity":false,"severity_phrase":"","subtype":null,"price":"","availability":"Only legal US access: clinical trials at Roswell Park, Buffalo, New York (also combined with nivolumab). Americans have smuggled it in through Canada or Mexico.","approval":"Approved in Cuba (2011), Argentina, Colombia, Peru and Paraguay. Not approved by the US FDA.","note":"Indicated for advanced non-small cell lung cancer after first-line chemotherapy."}]}]}